        "key": "515_01_006",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C05_515_01:515_01_006:aa049af2",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C05_515_01:515_01_006:aa049af2",
        "jp_sha256": "28705b93784f52b07442c67f35837ecd2fe66765ee350781e31c90380d5cb643",
        "official_en_sha256": "16fdb1633553c156052dc7fcfecbc021803fbf20a61a89ec3ce72e219d224711"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "「グリモア オブ ソーサリー」という本のようだ……。\r\n「祈りは天に、ささやきは地に。魔道を極めし者の書」\r\nと書かれている……。",
        "official_en": "The book is titled <text style=\"italic\">Grimoire Esoterica</>. An excerpt from it reads: “Pray to the heavens and whisper to the earth. May this tome find its way to the mage who has proven their worth.”",
        "real_en": "This book seems to be titled <text style=\"italic\">Grimoire of Sorcery</>. It says: 'Prayers to the heavens, whispers to the earth. A book for those who have mastered magic.'"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C05_515_01",
        "sequence": null,
