        "jp_sha256": "602b7b233378b7b5e5013b06a2dfa43d8d85ec679b5116ac12680b68c301eacf",
        "official_en_sha256": "9857b77c2106e2f7912b2f16d59fd9f36c8cfd6f6a0dc83cf39ef4575c0d254b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "「死に至る魔法」という本のようだ……。\r\n「生命を追求した黒魔道士がたどり着いた、禁断の秘術」\r\nと書かれている……。",
        "official_en": "The book is titled <text style=\"italic\">The Art of Death</>. It appears to be about a forbidden spell devised by a certain black mage obsessed with life.",
        "real_en": "This book seems to be titled <text style=\"italic\">Magic That Leads to Death</>. It says: 'A forbidden secret art discovered by a black mage in pursuit of life.'"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
