        "official_en_sha256": "65e40d861c8fc38c3ff559a9f82b66ee3e1400579893871921ab512603578266"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "「死者の皇国」という本のようだ……。\r\n「死してなお彷徨う者たちへの鎮魂歌」\r\nと書かれている……。",
        "official_en": "The book is titled <text style=\"italic\">The Demesne of the Dead</>. An excerpt from it reads: “May this be a requiem for the dead who still roam the land of the living...”",
        "real_en": "This book seems to be titled <text style=\"italic\">Empire of the Dead</>. It says: 'A requiem for those who still wander after death.'"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
