        "official_en_sha256": "eaa291afefb4ad4ccd4757dbc36341877d572b4e2da9be40778cae64dbca7b95"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "「石の歌う夢」という本のようだ……。\r\n「乙女は悪魔と恋に落ち、やがて石となった」\r\nと書かれている……。",
        "official_en": "The book is titled <text style=\"italic\">The Song of Stone</>. It appears to be about a maiden who falls in love with a demon and ends up turned to stone.",
        "real_en": "This book seems to be titled <text style=\"italic\">A Dream Where Stone Sings</>. It says: 'A maiden fell in love with a demon and eventually turned to stone.'"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
