        "official_en_sha256": "8f06fbd9930a03f37b15b59669c8318425d7c464edf0fcd4f77eea36c00d829b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "「誰がために彼は涙する」という本のようだ……。\r\n「心優しい巨人は慟哭し、怒りに身を任せた」\r\nと書かれている……。",
        "official_en": "The book is titled <text style=\"italic\">For Whom the Giant Weeps</>. It appears to be about a gentle giant who weeps in anguish and succumbs to his rage.",
        "real_en": "This book seems to be titled <text style=\"italic\">For Whom Does He Weep?</>. It says: 'A kindhearted giant wailed in grief and surrendered to his anger.'"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
